	<div class="col-sm-12">
		<h2>CPXHT - High temp dryers</h2>
		<p>
			A perfect complement to the RCP. With a maximum inlet temperature
			of 180F, no after-cooler is required. Included filtration eliminates dirt and oil
			giving you clean, dry compressed air. The CPXHT dryers are easy to install and have
			a compact design. Supplied with 115 Volt power means no special wiring is required
			and the space saving design incorporates an air cooled aftercooler, refrigerated
			air dryer, moisture separator, electronic water drain and coalescing filter.
		</p>
